  "_howToEdit": [
    "Shown on the home page (index.html) by js/linkedin-feed.js. Keep posts NEWEST FIRST; the first maxItems are shown.",
    "Each post needs a url (the post link on LinkedIn) and EITHER a title (shown as a card) OR an embedUrl (shown as LinkedIn's own embedded post).",
    "title, date (YYYY-MM-DD), image (https:// link or a site path such as img/post.jpg) and excerpt are for cards. embedUrl wins when both are present.",
    "embedUrl: on LinkedIn open the post, click ... then Embed this post, and copy the src=\"...\" value from the code (https://www.linkedin.com/embed/feed/update/...).",
    "Optional embedHeight (pixels, default 560) sets the height of an embedded post.",
    "Commit and push; the site updates on the next deploy. Check the file is still valid JSON (e.g. jsonlint.com) if the section disappears."
